url: "https://github.com/hongren-shen/wetland-hydrology-tools"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Python tools for wetland reclassification and depression contributing area
  delineation using GeoPandas and Rasterio. Two serial workflows classify
  wetlands from river and lake connections, trace ESRI D8 flow directions to
  depression seeds, and calculate contributing areas and subbasin fractions.
  The repository includes prepared inputs for gauge 02HB033, Mountsberg Creek
  near Carlisle, Ontario, and writes GeoPackage, GeoTIFF, and CSV outputs.
keywords:
  - hydrology
  - wetlands
  - depression contributing area
  - D8 flow direction
  - GeoPandas
  - Rasterio
  - OWL-Hydro
  - OLRRP
